·L·····················L··············\n        ···············K···················K···············\n        ················J·················J················\n        ·················I···············I·················\n        ··················H·············H··················\n        ···················G···········G···················\n        ····················F·········F····················\n        ·····················E·······E·····················\n        ······················D·····D······················\n        ·······················C···C·······················\n        ························B·B························\n        ·························A·························\n        \"\"\"\n        |> Str.replace_each(\"·\", \" \")\n    result == expected\n\n",
